&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;フィリピンにENPLAS SEMICONDUCTOR PERIPHERALS PTE.LTD.の子会社ENPLAS SEMICONDUCTOR PERIFHERALS PHILIPPINES,INC.設立。&lt;/p&gt;
